      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 844,
       "endIndex": 951,
       "text": "**The \"Front-Loaded\" Equity Schedule:** Google new-hire grants typically do not vest evenly at 25% per year"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 953,
       "endIndex": 1046,
       "text": "They are usually front-loaded (either **33% / 33% / 22% / 12%** or **38% / 32% / 20% / 10%**)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1054,
       "endIndex": 1132,
       "text": "While this boosts your Year 1 cash flow (e.g., ~$356k\u2013$410k in stock Year 1)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1054,
       "endIndex": 1181,
       "text": "While this boosts your Year 1 cash flow (e.g., ~$356k\u2013$410k in stock Year 1), it creates an **equity cliff in Years 3 and 4**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1188,
       "endIndex": 1333,
       "text": "Google relies on annual refreshers to fill that cliff, but as your recruiter noted, refreshes depend heavily on performance and market conditions"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2,
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1774,
       "endIndex": 1866,
       "text": "Google almost never puts their top-of-band numbers in the initial offer sheet for Senior PMs"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1868,
       "endIndex": 1967,
       "text": "Because you are content staying at Meta, you have maximum leverage to ask for a top-of-band package"
