     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3396,
       "endIndex": 3580,
       "text": "**Sign-on Bonus ($75,000 \u2013 $80,000):** Google frequently uses one-time sign-on bonuses to bridge the gap for candidates leaving unvested equity and upcoming bonuses at peer companies"
